# path flow name node_id
# One module per node, written as a depth-1 .tree. This is NOT ragged: every path is
# one level deep, so initTree takes its `maxDepth == 2 || twoLevel` shortcut and gives
# every top-level id a real module -- no leaf path is empty. Used as a regression guard
# against the .clu spelling of the same partition (twotriangles_singletons.clu).
1 0.3 "C" 3
2 0.2 "B" 2
3 0.15 "D" 4
4 0.1 "E" 5
5 0.1 "F" 6
6 0.15 "A" 1
